  "contentHtml": "<div><div class=\"txc-textbox\" style=\"padding: 10px; border: 3px double rgb(254, 137, 67); border-image: none; background-color: rgb(254, 222, 199);\"><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">&lt;재미있는 과학수업 만들기&gt;의 수업관련자료들은 선생님들의 '협업'을 위해 공유되고 있습니다. </span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">수업을 위한 자료로만 사용해주시기 바랍니다.&nbsp;</span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><b><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 11pt;\">** '말머리' 에서 해당단원을 선택해주세요. </span><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">수업자료를 찾기 쉬워집니다.**</span></span></b></p></div><p>자료보다가 하나 올려봐요~</p><p><br></p><p>저도 기획하면서 학생들이 할까할까 했는데 생각보다 잘해서 놀랐네요~</p><p>기발한 아이디어 샘플만 몇개 올려요~</p><p><br></p><p>자료 항상 감사합니다</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2165364C57CE9B2A10\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"1024\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"1024\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"IMG_6049.jpg\"  id=\"A_2165364C57CE9B2A103628\"/></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/274FEB4C57CE9B2B21\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"1024\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"1024\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"IMG_6050.jpg\"  id=\"A_274FEB4C57CE9B2B216B37\"/></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/25699E4C57CE9B2D0C\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"1024\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"1024\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"IMG_6051.jpg\"  id=\"A_25699E4C57CE9B2D0C8973\"/></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/263EAC5057CE9B4E1C\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"1024\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"1024\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"IMG_6052.jpg\"  id=\"A_263EAC5057CE9B4E1CBDA0\"/></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/25548B5057CE9B5008\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"1024\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"1024\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"IMG_6053.jpg\"  id=\"A_25548B5057CE9B5008E836\"/></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/233AA75057CE9B5220\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"1024\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"1024\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"IMG_6054.jpg\"  id=\"A_233AA75057CE9B52201E80\"/></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/261F705057CE9B5536\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"1024\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"1024\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"IMG_6055.jpg\"  id=\"A_261F705057CE9B55366B96\"/></p><p><br></p></div><p><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2162E24C57CE9B7513\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"1024\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"1024\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"IMG_6056.jpg\"  id=\"A_2162E24C57CE9B75135BE5\"/><br></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
